# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# NorthForge environment
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit `.env`.
#
# Vite exposes ONLY variables prefixed with `VITE_` to the browser. That
# prefix is the whole boundary: anything without it stays out of the bundle,
# so the Supabase SECRET / service-role key must never be given a VITE_ name.
#
# There is no application server to configure. The backend is Supabase
# (Postgres + RLS + Auth + Storage + Edge Functions), so `npm run dev` starts
# Vite and nothing else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# -- Supabase (public, bundled) ----------------------------------------
# Project URL + PUBLISHABLE (anon) key. On Vercel, set these in EVERY
# environment (Production, Preview, Development) and redeploy after changing
# them: Vite inlines env values at BUILD time, not at runtime.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-publishable-key

# -- Public site (bundled) ---------------------------------------------
# Site URL used for canonical links + OpenGraph.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://northforgestudio.vercel.app
# WhatsApp number in international format, digits only (country code, no +).
# This is the number every "Message us" button opens a chat with.
VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=919187006703

# -- SEO / analytics (public, bundled; optional) -----------------------
# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (format G-XXXXXXXXXX). Leave unset and no
# analytics script is requested at all. GA4 is additionally gated on visitor
# consent: with no decision, or an explicit "no", gtag.js is never loaded.
VITE_GA4_ID=
# Google Search Console verification token (the content= value of the
# google-site-verification meta tag). Injected at runtime when set.
VITE_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=

# -- Supabase Edge Function secrets (NOT Vite — never bundled) ---------
# Set these on the project, not in this file:
#
#   supabase secrets set \
#     WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=... \
#     WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=... \
#     WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN=... \
#     WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=...
#
# WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET is the Meta App Secret. The webhook verifies
# X-Hub-Signature-256 with it and REFUSES every event while it is unset.
# See docs/WHATSAPP_SETUP.md. Until the Cloud API credentials are set, the
# admin inbox falls back to wa.me deep links (still fully usable, and it never
# reports an undelivered message as sent).
